  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Slice zucchini into half-moons. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf46a14877becd77f2472/step-86d8ae00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook egg noodles over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Drain, rinse and drizzle with olive oil to prevent sticking. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf46a14877becd77f2472/step-2ad48010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Add carrot, zucchini and tofu and cook, tossing until tender and browned, 4-5 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium, add garlic and teriyaki seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add cooked egg noodles, hoisin sauce, the chilli flakes (if using), soy sauce, vinegar and water, tossing, until well combined, 1 min. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf46a14877becd77f2472/step-24e7eb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide teriyaki tofu and veggie noodle stir-fry between bowls.\n• Garnish with crispy shallots to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf46a14877becd77f2472/step-243a7c30.jpg"
    }
  ]
